@startuml
title Chunked Snapshot Transfer (§7 / §5.1 COW)
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

participant "Leader" as L
participant "Follower" as F

note over L: Follower's nextIndex <= snapshotIndex\nNeed to send snapshot instead of AppendEntries

L -> L: Load snapshot\nPack SM data + config data\ninto single byte stream
L -> L: Create SnapshotTransfer\n(tracks offset, inFlight)

== Chunk 1 ==
L -> F: InstallSnapshot(\n  lastIncludedIndex=100,\n  offset=0,\n  data=[chunk1],\n  done=false)

note over F: Buffer chunk at offset 0
F --> L: InstallSnapshotResponse(term=T)
note over L: Advance transfer.nextOffset

== Chunk 2 ==
L -> F: InstallSnapshot(\n  offset=1048576,\n  data=[chunk2],\n  done=false)

note over F: Append chunk to buffer
F --> L: InstallSnapshotResponse(term=T)

== Final Chunk ==
L -> F: InstallSnapshot(\n  offset=2097152,\n  data=[chunk3],\n  done=true)

note over F: Reassemble full snapshot\nUnpack SM + config data\nsaveSnapshotAndCompact\nrestoreSnapshot\nRecompute configuration
F --> L: InstallSnapshotResponse(term=T)

note over L: matchIndex[F] = 100\nnextIndex[F] = 101\nResume normal AppendEntries

@enduml
